B.RT=new A.bx("bld_granary_vault",B.as,"G\u0131da Ambar\u0131 (Lojistik & G\u0131da Deposu)","Food Storehouse (Logistics & Food Storage)","G\u0131da depolama kapasitesi ve 10x ta\u015f\u0131ma hacmi sa\u011flar. \u0130\u015f\xe7i kul\xfcbeleri g\u0131da depolayamad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in g\u0131da \xfcr\xfcnlerini depolar ve ta\u015f\u0131r.","Massive food storage and 10x hauling volume. Stores and transports food supplies since Worker Huts cannot store food.","G\u0131da Ambar\u0131, saf g\u0131da lojisti\u011fi ve depolama yap\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r. Tarlalar, otlaklar, f\u0131r\u0131nlar ve bal\u0131k\xe7\u0131lardan elde edilen g\u0131da \xfcr\xfcnleri yaln\u0131zca G\u0131da Ambar\u0131 ve \u015eato taraf\u0131ndan depolan\u0131p ta\u015f\u0131nabilir. \u0130\u015f\xe7i kul\xfcbeleri hammadde, ah\u015fap, ta\u015f ve madenleri ta\u015f\u0131r fakat g\u0131da depolayamaz.","The Food Storehouse is a specialized food logistics and storage hub. Food products gathered from farms, pastures, bakeries, and fisheries can only be stored and hauled via Food Storehouses and the Castle. Worker Huts haul raw materials, timber, stone, and ores, but cannot store food.",B.SN,B.p,"SV.2 | \xc7AYIR",B.a2P,B.I,B.I,B.Vn,B.Wg,B.Vq)
