B.Ya=s(["Sa\u011fdaki mor Diyar Se\xe7imi butonuna dokunun.","Kazanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z Tamga miktar\u0131n\u0131, Ta\xe7 \xf6d\xfcllerini ve Kurgan miras\u0131n\u0131 inceleyin.","G\xd6\xc7\xdc BA\u015eLAT butonuna basarak yeni topraklarda kat kat daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bir ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 yap\u0131n."],t.s)
B.X9=s(["Tap the purple Realm Migration button on the right toolbar.","Review your earned Tamga count, Crown rewards, and Kurgan relics.","Tap INITIATE MIGRATION to start fresh with permanent prestige multipliers."],t.s)
B.WJ=s(["\xdcSSEL DUVAR KURALI: 20-25 karoyu a\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda fetih maliyeti 1.6 \xfcss\xfcyle milyonlara f\u0131rlar. Asla tek haritada inat etmeyin; fetih t\u0131kand\u0131\u011f\u0131 an derhal B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 yap\u0131n.","Her B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7, toplam g\xf6\xe7 say\u0131n\u0131za ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak ek +%5 kal\u0131c\u0131 \xe7arpan kazand\u0131r\u0131r."],t.s)
B.WE=s(["EXPONENTIAL WALL: Conquest costs scale at 1.6^N. When costs spike into millions, migrate immediately instead of stalling.","Each migration adds an extra +5% permanent multiplier based on total migrations completed."],t.s)
B.Vv=s(["g\xf6\xe7","tamga","prestij","ta\xe7","kurgan","ata","kut","migration","prestige"],t.s)
B.RW=new A.bx("migration_prestige_tamga",B.lF,"B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 & Kadim Tamga (Prestij Sistemi)","Great Migration & Tamga Prestige","Diyar\u0131 terk edip k\xfcm\xfclatif Tamgalar, Ta\xe7lar ve ata miras\u0131 an\u0131tlar\u0131yla yeni topraklara g\xf6\xe7 etme.","Migrate to new realms, retaining cumulative Tamgas, Crown tokens, and Ancestral Kurgan relic echoes.",'Ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z yeterince b\xfcy\xfcd\xfc\u011f\xfcnde (en az 12 fethedilmi\u015f karo ve Seviye 5 Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131), sa\u011fdaki Harita butonuna basarak "B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7" ba\u015flatabilirsiniz. G\xf6\xe7 etti\u011finizde topraklar ve hammaddeler s\u0131f\u0131rlan\u0131r ancak yerine kal\u0131c\u0131 miraslar kazan\u0131l\u0131r:\n\n1. Atalar Tamgas\u0131 (Kal\u0131c\u0131 Kut \xc7arpan\u0131):\n\u2022 \u0130lk 50 Tamgaya kadar: Her Tamga t\xfcm krall\u0131k \xfcretimine net +%4 kal\u0131c\u0131 \xe7arpan verir.\n\u2022 50-100 Tamga: Logaritmik b\xfcy\xfcme ile istikrarl\u0131 artar.\n\u2022 100+ Tamga (Mega Patlama): Tamga say\u0131s\u0131 100 baraj\u0131n\u0131 a\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda oyunun form\xfcl\xfc s\u0131\xe7rama yaparak devasa 11.0x Kut \xc7arpan\u0131n\u0131 tetikler!\n\n2. \u015ean & Kut Ta\xe7lar\u0131 (Crowns):\n\u2022 Sahip olunan her 5 karo = 1 Ta\xe7\n\u2022 Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131n her 2 seviyesi = 1 Ta\xe7\n\u2022 \u0130n\u015fa edilen her 15 bina kademesi = 1 Ta\xe7\n\u2022 Kademeli ambar refah\u0131 = 1-4 Ta\xe7\n\u2022 Ta\xe7lar T\xf6re Meclisindeki ferman ve doktrinleri kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak a\xe7mak i\xe7in harcan\u0131r.\n\n3. Ata Kurganlar\u0131 (Ancestral Kurgans):\nEski diyardaki en y\xfcksek seviyeli binalar\u0131n\u0131z yeni haritada kadim kurgan h\xf6y\xfckleri olarak belirir; ke\u015ffedildiklerinde devasa kal\u0131c\u0131 aura \xfcretir.',"Once reaching 12+ hexes and Castle Level 5, initiate the Great Migration. You earn permanent Tamga tokens (+4% global Kut multiplier each, jumping to 11.0x at 100+ Tamgas), Crowns for doctrine unlocks, and leave behind Ancestral Kurgans.",B.fE,B.cN,"PREST\u0130J MOTORU",B.a2S,B.Ya,B.X9,B.WJ,B.WE,B.Vv)
